# The 3.5" 480x320 panel of zero8 and the Pi 3A+ (6.3 px/mm, board.conf 79x49 mm), landscape and in PDA mode
# (320x480 narrow portrait): the automatic display scale is 1.5x; the tabs, a list, the terms dialog, the key page
# with the on-screen keyboard.
title zero8 density (6.3 px/mm): map 1.5x, lists, dialog, key page
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.886392,2.27417,15

wait 1500
shot map-zero8
key tab
wait 600
shot sources-zero8
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key enter
wait 600
shot terms-zero8
key esc
wait 400
key down
key enter
wait 800
shot key-zero8
expect osk on
key esc
key esc
wait 400
key tab
wait 600
shot settings-zero8
expect text "Auto (1.5x)"
key esc
expect quit
